 class="relative flex h-full flex-col justify-end gap-2 px-6 py-10"><span class="font-sans text-uppercase-12 tracking-[6px] text-text-muted uppercase">Route</span><h3 class="font-display text-display-28 text-global-white uppercase italic">Colorado River | UTAH | USA</h3></div></article></div><div role="group" aria-roledescription="slide" class="min-w-0 shrink-0 grow-0 basis-auto pl-4"><article class="relative flex h-80 w-60 flex-col justify-end overflow-hidden bg-global-dark-ink-blue-300"><picture><img class="teaser-card-mask absolute top-0 h-60 w-full" src="https://images.rouvy.com/OSCbjcgB58vAMVLziiS23-8rqPY=/center/middle/%2Fcms%2Fcard_routes_d00cf6ba71%2Fcard_routes_d00cf6ba71.png" alt="3500+ more routes" loading="lazy" decoding="auto"/></picture><div class="relative flex h-full flex-col justify-end gap-2 px-6 py-10"><span class="font-sans text-uppercase-12 tracking-[6px] text-text-muted uppercase"> </span><h3 class="font-display text-display-28 text-global-white uppercase italic">3500+ more routes</h3></div></article></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="overflow-hidden pt-10 pb-20 md:py-24" id="workouts"><div class="relative container"><div class="absolute top-80 -ml-4 flex h-full w-full justify-center sm:top-36 md:-top-24 md:-right-40 lg:right-[-300px]"><picture><img class="teaser-mask hidden h-[743px] w-[1056px] max-w-none object-cover md:block" src="https://images.rouvy.com/WY-bU_L9Va7KBaVw-_NeNzvCxto=/center/middle/%2Fcms%2Fcontent_teaser_visma_and_lidl_trek_new_jerseys_7cb3cdfd04%2Fcontent_teaser_visma_and_lidl_trek_new_jerseys_7cb3cdfd04.png" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="auto"/></picture><picture><img class="teaser-mask block h-auto w-[600px] max-w-none object-cover sm:w-[800px] md:hidden" src="https://images.rouvy.com/WY-bU_L9Va7KBaVw-_NeNzvCxto=/center/middle/%2Fcms%2Fcontent_teaser_visma_and_lidl_trek_new_jerseys_7cb3cdfd04%2Fcontent_teaser_visma_and_lidl_trek_new_jerseys_7cb3cdfd04.png" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="auto"/></picture></