lon_workout_coll_39d6897171.png" alt="Block 1: Half-Distance Triathlon" loading="lazy" decoding="auto"/></picture><div class="relative flex h-full flex-col justify-end gap-2 px-6 py-10"><span class="font-sans text-uppercase-12 tracking-[6px] text-text-muted uppercase">Training plan</span><h3 class="font-display text-display-28 text-global-white uppercase italic">Block 1: Half-Distance Triathlon</h3></div></article></div><div role="group" aria-roledescription="slide" class="min-w-0 shrink-0 grow-0 basis-auto pl-4"><article class="relative flex h-80 w-60 flex-col justify-end overflow-hidden bg-global-dark-ink-blue-300"><picture><img class="teaser-card-mask absolute top-0 h-60 w-full" src="https://images.rouvy.com/49OXo2ILB_yGTZ8kqEhgIE9_mFg=/center/middle/%2Fcms%2Fcard_workouts_8f813772c0%2Fcard_workouts_8f813772c0.png" alt="600+ workouts" loading="lazy" decoding="auto"/></picture><div class="relative flex h-full flex-col justify-end gap-2 px-6 py-10"><span class="font-sans text-uppercase-12 tracking-[6px] text-text-muted uppercase"> </span><h3 class="font-display text-display-28 text-global-white uppercase italic">600+ workouts</h3></div></article></div></div></div></div></div></div><div><div><div class="divide-y divide-border-secondary-subtle"><div><div class="container py-20 md:py-10"><div class="flex flex-col items-center gap-10 lg:flex-row xl:gap-8 lg:order-10"><div class="mx-auto max-w-full md:max-w-[500px] lg:max-w-[528px] xl:max-w-[696px] 2xl:max-w-[752px] lg:order-10 max-lg:order-last"><picture><source srcSet="https://images.rouvy.com/yn_10peL_YUCyjJIowKdSlEeVYE=/center/middle/%2Fcms%2Fthumbnail_new_integrations_HP_1bb923e065%2Fthumbnail_new_integrations_HP_1bb923e065.png 125w" media="(max-width: 125px)" width="209" height="209"/><source srcSet="https://images.rouvy.com/XFG835vIXaBKs6vrV3nMQ_veoQY=/center/middle/%2Fcms%2Fsmall_new_integrations_HP_1bb923e065%2Fsmall_new_integrations_HP_1bb923e065.png 250w" media="(max-width: 250px)" width="500" height="500"/><source srcSet="https://images.rouvy.com/jZMGbBN3aAetJY342IMIvFEramM=/center/middle/%2Fcms%2Fmedium_new_integrations_HP_1bb923e065%2Fmedium_new_integrations_HP_1bb923e065.png 375w" media="(max-width: 375px)" width="750" height="750"/><img class="block aspect-square object-contain" src="https://images.rouvy.com/1NAK8J-LnwKsu1CkWGvYkCZwSgM=/752x560/center/middle/%2Fcms%2Fnew_integrations_HP_1bb923e065%2Fnew_integrations_HP_1bb923e065.png" alt="" width="752" height="560" loading="lazy" decoding="auto"/></picture></div><div class="mx-auto max-w-full md:max-w-[348px] lg:max-w-[368px] xl:max-w-[488px] 2xl:max-w-[528px] lg:order-2 flex flex-col items-center gap-4 py-6 max-lg:order-first lg:items-start xl:gap-6 xl:py-0"><h4 class="text-center font-display text-body-32 font-extrabold text-text-default uppercase italic lg:text-left xl:text-display-48">ROUVY’S ALWAYS ADDING NEW FITNESS APP INTEGRATIONS</h4><div class="block-description text-center lg:text-left"><article><p>You can seamlessly integrate ROUVY and the leading fitness-tracking platforms, allowing you to track your outdoor and indoor efforts in one place, and import customized workouts. ROUVY syncs with Strava, GARMIN Connect, TrainingPeaks, TriDot and many others.</p></article></div><div class="flex w-full flex-wrap justify-center gap-4 lg:justify-start"></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div id="pricing"><div class="container py-24"><div class="flex flex-col items-center gap-12 lg:gap-16"><div class="flex flex-col gap-6"><h4 class="text-center font-display text-body-32 font-extrabold text-text-default uppercase italic md:text-display-40 lg:text-display-48">Flexible plans and a 7-day free trial</h4><span class="block-description text-center"></span></div><div class="-mt-10 -mb-12 w-full"><div class="@container/plans mx-auto mt-10 mb-12"><div class="mb-12 flex justify-center"><div class="flex w-full max-w-[400px] gap-0.5 rounded-full border border-border-secondary bg-background-canvas p-0.5"><button class="relative inline-flex cursor-pointer items-center rounded-full text-center text-nowrap uppercase disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:cursor-default bg-button-default-background-rest fill-button-default-text-default text-button-default-text-default hover:bg-button-default-background-hover active:bg-button-default-background-active-pressed disabled:opacity-40 gap-2 px-[20px] py-[10px] font-[700] md:px-6 md:py-3 md:text-body-16 shrink basis-1/2 justify-center ring-0 transition-all duration-200 ease-in-out"><span class="text-body-12 leading-4 font-semibold normal-case md:text-body-14">Yearly<!-- --> <span class="text-text-accent"></span></span></button><button class="relative inline-flex cursor-pointer items-center rounded-full text-center text-nowrap uppercase disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:cursor-default fill-button-alternative-text-default text-button-alternative-text-default ring-button-alternative-border-default ring-inset hover:ring-button-alternative-border-hover disabled:ring-button-alternative-border-active-pressed gap-2 px-[20px] py-[10px] font-[700] md:px-6 md:py-3 md:text-body-16 shrink basis-1/2 justify-center ring-0 transition-all duration-200 ease-in-out"><span class="text-body-12 leading-4 font-semibold normal-case md:text-body-14">Monthly<!-- --> </span></button></div></div><div class="isolate flex flex-col justify-center gap-8 md:gap-10 @3xl/plans:flex-row"><div class="relative flex flex-col gap-6 bg-background-subtle px-6 py-8 md:gap-8 md:px-8 md:py-12"><h3 class="font-bold tracking-mega text-global-white uppercase">Single</h3><div class="h-[3px] w-12 bg-global-electric-indigo-700"></div><div class="flex flex-col items-start"><div class="font-display text-display-48 font-bold whitespace-nowrap text-global-jonquil-yellow-800 italic @3xl/plans:text-display-40 @4xl/plans:text-display-48 @6xl/plans:text-display-60">15,00 €<span class="pl-1 text-[24px] font-semibold text-global-white">/<!-- -->mo</span></div><div class="text-body-16 font-semibold text-global-white md:text-body-18 lg:text-body-18">billed yearly</div></div><div class="text-start text-body-14 leading-loose font-semibold text-text-muted md:text-body-16 lg:text-body-18"><p>1 account</p><p>7 days free trial</p></div></div><div class="relative flex flex-col gap-6 bg-background-subtle px-6 py-8 md:gap-8 md:px-8 md:py-12"><h3 class="font-bold tracking-mega text-global-white uppercase">Duo</h3><div class="h-[3px] w-12 bg-global-electric-indigo-700"></div><div class="flex flex-col items-start"><div class="font-display text-display-48 font-bold whitespace-nowrap text-global-jonquil-yellow-800 italic @3xl/plans:text-display-40 @4xl/plans:text-display-48 @6xl/plans:text-display-60">20,83 €<span class="pl-1 text-[24px] font-semibold text-global-white">/<!-- -->mo</span></div><div class="text-body-16 font-semibold text-global-white md:text-body-18 lg:text-body-18">billed yearly</div></div><div class="text-start text-body-14 leading-loose font-semibold text-text-muted md:text-body-16 lg:text-body-18"><p>up to 2 accounts</p><p>7 days free trial</p></div></div><div class="relative flex flex-col gap-6 bg-background-subtle px-6 py-8 md:gap-8 md:px-8 md:py-12"><h3 class="font-bold tracking-mega text-global-white uppercase">Group</h3><div class="h-[3px] w-12 bg-global-electric-indigo-700"></div><div class="flex flex-col items-start"><div class="font-display text-display-48 font-bold whitespace-nowrap text-global-jonquil-yellow-800 italic @3xl/plans:text-display-40 @4xl/plans:text-display-48 @6xl/plans:text-display-60">41,67 €<span class="pl-1 text-[24px] font-semibold text-global-white">/<!-- -->mo</span></div><div class="text-body-16 font-semibold text-global-white md:text-body-18 lg:text-body-18">billed yearly</div></div><div class="text-start text-body-14 leading-loose font-semibold text-text-muted md:text-body-16 lg:text-body-18"><p>up to 5 accounts</p><p>7 days free trial</p></div></div></div></div></div><div class="prose-xl prose-headings:font-display prose-headings:font-extrabold prose-headings:text-text-default prose-headings:uppercase prose-headings:italic prose-h1:text-display-48 prose-h2:text-display-32 prose-h3:text-display-24 prose-h4:text-body-20 prose-h5:text-body-18 prose-h6:text-body-16 prose-p:text-body-16 prose-p:text-text-muted prose-a:text-link-rest visited:prose-a:text-text-secondary hover:prose-a:text-link-hover prose-strong:font-bold prose-strong:text-text-muted prose-ol:list-decimal prose-ul:list-disc prose-li:text-body-14 prose-li:text-text-default prose-th:text-body-16 prose-th:text-text-default prose-td:text-body-14 prose-td:text-text-muted prose-hr:h-[1px] prose-hr:w-full prose-hr:shrink-0 prose-hr:border-border-secondary-subtle text-center text-body-12 leading-normal font-medium md:text-left prose-p:my-0"><article><p>Choose from three monthly and three yearly plans to find the ideal option for your indoor cycling routine and budget. All ROUVY subscription plans begin with a free, 7-day trial, then are billed at the full monthly or yearly price.</p></article></div></div></div></div><div><div><div class="divide-y divide-border-secondary-subtle"><div><div class="container py-20 md:py-10"><div class="flex flex-col items-center gap-10 lg:flex-row xl:gap-8 lg:order-10"><div class="mx-auto max-w-full md:max-w-[500px] lg:max-w-[528px] xl:max-w-[696px] 2xl:max-w-[752px] lg:order-10 max-lg:order-last"><picture><source srcSet="https://images.rouvy.com/iE0P59pK6oP9KZWlCdfuhYEvEkg=/752x560/center/middle/%2Fcms%2Fthumbnail_EN_HP_5bbdb8ceb0%2Fthumbnail_EN_HP_5bbdb8ceb0.png 125w" media="(max-width: 125px)" width="209" height="209"/><source srcSet="https://images.rouvy.com/2uvCfSZhcyog4uw5z1pVKSNLKCw=/752x560/center/middle/%2Fcms%2Fsmall_EN_HP_5bbdb8ceb0%2Fsmall_EN_HP_5bbdb8ceb0.png 250w" media="(max-width: 250px)" width="500" height="500"/><source srcSet="https://images.rouvy.com/V1FFu60EQPuDqJYYS8QPa57wNeA=/752x560/center/middle/%2Fcms%2Fmedium_EN_HP_5bbdb8ceb0%2Fmedium_EN_HP_5bbdb8ceb0.png 375w" media="(max-width: 375px)" width="750" height="750"/><img class="block aspect-square object-contain" src="https://images.rouvy.com/8yG-vQYTYC3nYvspWjSC2wtesIE=/752x560/center/middle/%2Fcms%2FEN_HP_5bbdb8ceb0%2FEN_HP_5bbdb8ceb0.png" alt="" width="752" height="560" loading="lazy" decoding="auto"/></picture></div><div class="mx-auto max-w-full md:max-w-[348px] lg:max-w-[368px] xl:max-w-[488px] 2xl:max-w-[528px] lg:order-2 flex flex-col items-center gap-4 py-6 max-lg:order-first lg:items-start xl:gap-6 xl:py-0"><h4 class="text-center font-display text-body-32 font-extrabold text-text-default uppercase italic lg:text-left xl:text-display-48">WHAT DOES THE ROUVY APP DO?</h4><div class="block-description text-center lg:text-left"><article><p>ROUVY connects with your indoor trainer to let you see real video of the route you’re riding. The app, connected to your trainer, knows the gradient of this route and will adjust the resistance of your bike to match the gradient.</p></article></div><div class="flex w-full flex-wrap justify-center gap-4 lg:justify-start"></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div id="start"><div class="py-20"><div class="container overflow-clip"><h3 class="mb-8 text-center font-display text-body-32 font-extrabold text-text-default uppercase italic md:text-display-40 xl:text-display-48">start riding in three easy steps</h3><div class="hidden md:block"><div class="relative" aria-roledescription="carousel"><div class="overflow-hidden"><div class="flex -ml-4"><div role="group" aria-roledescription="slide" class="min-w-0 shrink-0 grow-0 pl-4 basis-[calc((100%-80rem)/2)]"></div><div role="group" aria-roledescription="slide" class="min-w-0 shrink-0 grow-0 basis-auto pl-0"><article class="w-[416px]" id="start_1"><div class="mx-auto flex items-center justify-center p-6 lg:p-4"><picture><source srcSet="https://images.rouvy.com/0LlZdgsqoNyNxhRo5rpBVN2M3uU=/752x560/center/middle/%2Fcms%2Fthumbnail_howto1_ad1a2f3424%2Fthumbnail_howto1_ad1a2f3424.png 125w" media="(max-width: 125px)" width="156" height="156"/><img class="aspect-square h-[200px] object-contain" src="https://images.rouvy.com/94p5ODXNP1IOFes821qRqytiInM=/260x260/center/middle/%2Fcms%2Fhowto1_ad1a2f3424%2Fhowto1_ad1a2f3424.png" alt="" width="260" height="260" loading="lazy" decoding="auto"/></picture></div><div class="mx-auto flex max-w-md flex-col gap-y-4"><div class="relative"><span class="absolute top-1/2 left-52 h-0.5 w-[430px] bg-global-deep-indigo-700"></span><div class="relative z-10 mx-auto grid size-12 place-items-center rounded-full bg-background-subtle text-body-16 text-text-default xl:text-body-20">1</div></div><h4 class="mx-auto max-w-[320px] text-center text-body-16 font-semibold text-text-default xl:text-body-20">Create an account and download the app</h4><p class="mx-auto max-w-[320px] text-center text-body-12 font-semibold text-text-muted xl:text-body-16">The ROUVY app is available on PC, Mac, iPad, Android, iPhone, and Apple TV.</p></div></article></div><div role="group" aria-roledescription="slide" class="min-w-0 shrink-0 grow-0 pl-4 basis-auto"><article class="w-[416px]" id="start_2"><div class="mx-auto flex items-center justify-center p-6 lg:p-4"><picture><source srcSet="https://images.rouvy.com/rewG_JKVDLz_WumX-TrpiVt-wwg=/260x260/center/middle/%2Fcms%2Fthumbnail_howto_step_2_d9d3a772c3%2Fthumbnail_howto_step_2_d9d3a772c3.png 125w" media="(max-width: 125px)" width="144" height="144"/><img class="aspect-square h-[200px] object-contain" src="https://images.rouvy.com/JudakGV5-8iihw1Iqqgc0tiD6t4=/242x263/center/middle/%2Fcms%2Fhowto_step_2_d9d3a772c3%2Fhowto_step_2_d9d3a772c3.png" alt="" width="242" height="263" loading="lazy" decoding="auto"/></picture></div><div class="mx-auto flex max-w-md flex-col gap-y-4"><div class="relative"><span class="absolute top-1/2 left-52 h-0.5 w-[430px] bg-global-deep-indigo-700"></span><div class="relative z-10 mx-auto grid size-12 place-items-center rounded-full bg-background-subtle text-body-16 text-text-default xl:text-body-20">2</div></div><h4 class="mx-auto max-w-[320px] text-center text-body-16 font-semibold text-text-default xl:text-body-20">Connect your trainer</h4><p class="mx-auto max-w-[320px] text-center text-body-12 font-semibold text-text-muted xl:text-body-16">Your trainer will automatically connect when you first open the app.</p></div></article></div><div role="group" aria-roledescription="slide" class="min-w-0 shrink-0 grow-0 pl-4 basis-auto"><article class="w-[416px]" id="start_3"><div class="mx-auto flex items-center justify-center p-6 lg:p-4"><picture><source srcSet="https://images.rouvy.com/wSTRdJwUg0sKIiW9eYgj92x-Y5Q=/242x263/center/middle/%2Fcms%2Fthumbnail_howto3_new2_6b031eca7e%2Fthumbnail_howto3_new2_6b031eca7e.png 125w" media="(max-width: 125px)" width="156" height="156"/><img class="aspect-square h-[200px] object-contain" src="https://images.rouvy.com/wBJURxZ56Ku3QT0bP4bYbmj7x4Y=/260x260/center/middle/%2Fcms%2Fhowto3_new2_6b031eca7e%2Fhowto3_new2_6b031eca7e.png" alt="" width="260" height="260" loading="lazy" decoding="auto"/></picture></div><div class="mx-auto flex max-w-md flex-col gap-y-4"><div class="relative"><span class="absolute top-1/2 left-52 h-0.5 w-[430px] bg-global-deep-indigo-700 hidden"></span><div class="relative z-10 mx-auto grid size-12 place-items-center rounded-full bg-background-subtle text-body-16 text-text-default xl:text-body-20">3</div></div><h4 class="mx-auto max-w-[320px] text-center text-body-16 font-semibold text-text-default xl:text-body-20">Start riding</h4><p class="mx-auto max-w-[320px] text-center text-body-12 font-semibold text-text-muted xl:text-body-16">Imagine a place you&#x27;ve always wanted to explore on your bike and start your journey.</p></div></article></div></div></div></div></div><div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-y-10 md:hidden"><article id="start_1"><div class="mx-auto flex items-center justify-center p-6 lg:p-4"><picture><source srcSet="https://images.rouvy.com/1ARsJq2fp58XYoMu4Zj1SjE5rSQ=/260x260/center/middle/%2Fcms%2Fthumbnail_howto1_ad1a2f3424%2Fthumbnail_howto1_ad1a2f3424.png 125w" media="(max-width: 125px)" width="156" height="156"/><img class="aspect-square h-[200px] object-contain" src="https://images.rouvy.com/94p5ODXNP1IOFes821qRqytiInM=/260x260/center/middle/%2Fcms%2Fhowto1_ad1a2f3424%2Fhowto1_ad1a2f3424.png" alt="" width="260" height="260" loading="lazy" decoding="auto"/></picture></div><div class="mx-auto flex max-w-md flex-col gap-y-4"><div class="relative"><span class="absolute top-1/2 h-0.5 w-[200%] bg-global-deep-indigo-700 left-1/2"></span><div class="relative z-10 mx-auto grid size-12 place-items-center rounded-full bg-background-subtle text-body-16 text-text-default xl:text-body-20">1</div></div><h4 class="text-center text-body-16 font-semibold text-text-default xl:text-body-20">Create an account and download the app</h4><p class="text-center text-body-12 font-semibold text-text-muted xl:text-body-16">The ROUVY app is available on PC, Mac, iPad, Android, iPhone, and Apple TV.</p></div></article><article id="start_2"><div class="mx-auto flex items-center justify-center p-6 lg:p-4"><picture><source srcSet="https://images.rouvy.com/rewG_JKVDLz_WumX-TrpiVt-wwg=/260x260/center/middle/%2Fcms%2Fthumbnail_howto_step_2_d9d3a772c3%2Fthumbnail_howto_step_2_d9d3a772c3.png 125w" media="(max-width: 125px)" width="144" height="144"/><img class="aspect-square h-[200px] object-contain" src="https://images.rouvy.com/JudakGV5-8iihw1Iqqgc0tiD6t4=/242x263/center/middle/%2Fcms%2Fhowto_step_2_d9d3a772c3%2Fhowto_step_2_d9d3a772c3.png" alt="" width="242" height="263" loading="lazy" decoding="auto"/></picture></div><div class="mx-auto flex max-w-md flex-col gap-y-4"><div class="relative"><span class="absolute top-1/2 -left-1/2 h-0.5 w-[200%] bg-global-deep-indigo-700"></span><div class="relative z-10 mx-auto grid size-12 place-items-center rounded-full bg-background-subtle text-body-16 text-text-default xl:text-body-20">2</div></div><h4 class="text-center text-body-16 font-semibold text-text-default xl:text-body-20">Connect your trainer</h4><p class="text-center text-body-12 font-semibold text-text-muted xl:text-body-16">Your trainer will automatically connect when you first open the app.</p></div></article><article id="start_3"><div class="mx-auto flex items-center justify-center p-6 lg:p-4"><picture><source srcSet="https://images.rouvy.com/wSTRdJwUg0sKIiW9eYgj92x-Y5Q=/242x263/center/middle/%2Fcms%2Fthumbnail_howto3_new2_6b031eca7e%2Fthumbnail_howto3_new2_6b031eca7e.png 125w" media="(max-width: 125px)" width="156" height="156"/><img class="aspect-square h-[200px] object-contain" src="https://images.rouvy.com/wBJURxZ56Ku3QT0bP4bYbmj7x4Y=/260x260/center/middle/%2Fcms%2Fhowto3_new2_6b031eca7e%2Fhowto3_new2_6b031eca7e.png" alt="" width="260" height="260" loading="lazy" decoding="auto"/></picture></div><div class="mx-auto flex max-w-md flex-col gap-y-4"><div class="relative"><span class="absolute top-1/2 h-0.5 w-[200%] bg-global-deep-indigo-700 right-1/2 left-[unset]"></span><div class="relative z-10 mx-auto grid size-12 place-items-center rounded-full bg-background-subtle text-body-16 text-text-default xl:text-body-20">3</div></div><h4 class="text-center text-body-16 font-semibold text-text-default xl:text-body-20">Start riding</h4><p class="text-center text-body-12 font-semibold text-text-muted xl:text-body-16">Imagine a place you&#x27;ve always wanted to explore on your bike and start your journey.</p></div></article></div></div></div></div><div id="register"><div class="py-20 md:py-32"><div class="container"><div class="relative flex flex-col items-center px-4 py-20"><div><div class="absolute inset-0" style="background:radial-gradient(121.07% 300% at -20% 217.45%, rgba(111, 16, 231, 0.40) 0%, rgba(124, 16, 231, 0.00) 100%)"></div><div class="absolute inset-0" style="background:radial-gradient(170.79% 240.66% at 180% -50.97%, rgba(252, 205, 0, 0.40) 0%, rgba(216, 156, 0, 0.00) 100%)"></div></div><div class="mx-auto max-w-full md:max-w-[424px] lg:max-w-[448px] xl:max-w-[592px] 2xl:max-w-[640px] relative"><div class="z-50 flex flex-col gap-4"><h3 class="text-center font-display text-body-32 font-extrabold text-text-default uppercase italic md:text-display-40 lg:text-display-48">Try ROUVY for free today</h3><p class="text-center text-body-16 font-semibold text-text-muted xl:text-body-20">Discover a completely new way to ride indoors by entering your email below.</p><form noValidate="" id="register-cta-form" data-discover="true" action="/resources/register" method="post"><div class="flex flex-col gap-4 md:flex-row md:items-center"><div class="flex flex-row place-items-center gap-2 bg-input-background-default ring-1 ring-border-secondary ring-inset has-[:disabled]:cursor-not-allowed has-[:focus-visible]:ring-2 has-[:focus-visible]:ring-border-focus px-3 md:px-4 w-full flex-1 md:max-w-[332px]"><input class="peer flex w-full bg-transparent text-text-default placeholder:text-text-muted focus-visible:outline-hidden disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-50 py-3 text-body-14 leading-[16px] md:text-body-16 md:leading-[24px]" id="register-cta-form-email" form="register-cta-form" required="" minLength="3" maxLength="200" placeholder="E-mail" name="email" value=""/></div><button class="relative inline-flex shrink-0 cursor-pointer items-center rounded-full text-center text-nowrap uppercase transition-all disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:cursor-default bg-button-highlight-background-rest fill-button-highlight-text-default text-button-highlight-text-default hover:bg-button-highlight-background-hover active:bg-button-highlight-background-active-pressed disabled:bg-button-highlight-background-active-pressed gap-2 px-[20px] py-[10px] font-[700] md:px-6 md:py-3 md:text-body-16 w-full justify-center md:w-auto" type="submit">Register</button></div><ul class="py-1"><li class="py-1 text-body-14 text-text-negative"> </li></ul><input type="hidden" name="campaignId" value="30"/><input type="hidden" name="linkAfterEmailSubmit"/><input type="hidden" name="utmParams" value=""/></form></div></div><div class="mt-10 grid grid-cols-2 place-items-center gap-x-12 gap-y-6 md:grid-cols-4 md:gap-x-20 md:gap-y-0"><div class="flex h-[120px] w-[120px] flex-col items-center text-center text-text-muted"><svg class="inline self-center h-[80px] w-[80px] md:h-[120px] md:w-[120px]"><use href="/assets/sprite-BHcpGKNd.svg#notebook"></use></svg><span class="font-bold">Windows, Mac</span></div><div class="flex h-[120px] w-[120px] flex-col items-center text-center text-text-muted"><svg class="inline self-center h-[80px] w-[80px] md:h-[120px] md:w-[120px]"><use href="/assets/sprite-BHcpGKNd.svg#android"></use></svg><span class="font-bold">iOS, Android</span></div><div class="flex h-[120px] w-[120px] flex-col items-center text-center text-text-muted"><svg class="inline self-center h-[80px] w-[80px] md:h-[120px] md:w-[120px]"><use href="/assets/sprite-BHcpGKNd.svg#ipad"></use></svg><span class="font-bold">iPad</span></div><div class="flex h-[120px] w-[120px] flex-col items-center text-center text-text-muted"><svg class="inline self-center h-[80px] w-[80px] md:h-[120px] md:w-[120px]"><use href="/assets/sprite-BHcpGKNd.svg#apple-tv"></use></svg><span class="font-bold">Apple TV</span></div></div></div></div></div></div><div><div class="py-20 md:py-24" id="faq"><div class="container"><div class="mx-auto max-w-full lg:max-w-[768px] xl:max-w-[1008px] 2xl:max-w-[1088px]"><h3 class="font-display text-body-32 font-extrabold text-text-default uppercase italic md:text-display-40 xl:text-display-48">FAQ</h3><div class="mt-8 w-full border-t border-t-border-secondary-subtle" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" class="border-b border-border-secondary-subtle py-8"><h3 data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed" class="flex"><button type="button" aria-controls="radix-:R136j35:" aria-expanded="false" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" id="radix-:R36j35:"